# Copy to a file of your own and `source` it before scripts/code/train.sh, or
# set these inline. Only the first three have no default.
#
#   set -a; . scripts/code/env.example; set +a; scripts/code/train.sh
#
# This lists what is worth changing on other hardware, not every variable
# scripts/code/train.sh exports. The ones it omits -- loss aggregation, advantage
# normalisation, the dynamic-sampling filter, entropy chunking, the sampling
# temperature -- are the reference run's measured values, and listing them in a
# file labelled "copy and change" would invite changing them. Read them in
# scripts/code/train.sh, where each carries the reason it has that value.

# --- required ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Policy checkpoint. HF layout or a Megatron-converted directory.
MODEL_PATH=/path/to/policy-checkpoint
# Rows must carry extra_info.dataset_type == "opensource-code"; see
# mimoagent-osr's OpenSourceCodeEnvironment for the eight required fields.
# Comma-separate to train on several parquets.
TRAIN_DATA=/path/to/code.parquet
VAL_DATA=/path/to/code-val.parquet

# --- cluster ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Defaults describe 8 nodes x 8 GPUs with rollout colocated on the training
# GPUs. ACTOR_TP must divide the GPUs per node; ROLLOUT_NNODES=0 means colocate.
# TRAIN_NNODES=8
# TRAIN_NGPUS_PER_NODE=8
# ROLLOUT_NNODES=0
# ACTOR_TP=8
# ACTOR_CP=1
# ROLLOUT_TP=2

# --- rollout ----------------------------------------------------------------
# N is the GRPO group size. With four harness arms and step-hash mixing, a
# group stays on one arm and the sample rotates across arms between steps, so N
# does not need to be a multiple of four.
# N=16
# TRAIN_BATCH_SIZE=64
# TOTAL_STEPS=200
# MAXLEN=262144

# --- task pods --------------------------------------------------------------
# Each session is a pod. MAX_CONCURRENT_SESSIONS is the ceiling on live pods,
# so it is bounded by cluster quota rather than by GPU memory.
# MAX_CONCURRENT_SESSIONS=1024
# AGENT_NUM_WORKERS=64
# TRAJECTORY_TIMEOUT=7200

# Kubeconfig for the cluster that runs the task pods. The harness profiles in
# config/agent/code/ also name one; this is the one the trainer itself uses.
# KUBECONFIG=/path/to/kubeconfig

# --- harness mix ------------------------------------------------------------
# Defaults to config/agent/code/mix-four-whitebox.yaml in this repository. Point
# it at another spec to train a different set of arms; a one-armed run is a spec
# with one entry.
# MIMOAGENT_HARNESS_SPEC=/path/to/mix.yaml
# MIXED_HARNESS_MODE=step-hash
# The seed decides which arm each sample routes to, so changing it changes the
# experiment rather than just the shuffle. This is the reference run's value.
# MIXED_HARNESS_SEED=20260911
